  "description": "Discovery II is the second in\n\nthe series of affordable dual-suspension Fuji mountain bikes. Its aluminum\n\nmain frame is the same as the more expensive Discovery III's. The pivoted\n\npart of the II's frame is steel, and operates a Tough Shock MA, same as the\n\nIII's. Discovery II's fork is an RST Mozo, 63mm travel.\n\nShifting is Shimano and Sram, controlled by Sram Gripshift. Pedals are Wellgo\n\nand accept clips and straps. Hubs are Fuji Oversized aluminum, rims Alex aluminum. Discovery II's suspension makes rough trails easy on your\n\nbody. Discovery II's price makes buying one easy on your wallet. See for yourself\n\nat your Fuji store.",
